### AC1: Successful Media Upload (Single Image)
# Tests: Valid JWT token, user owns challenge, valid image file
# Expected: HTTP 200 OK with entity key response
# Note: Replace [binary image data] with actual image file in multipart request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{validChallengeKey}}/media
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
X-API-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary123

--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="challenge_screenshot.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< D:\Documents\Pictures\tua64yb.jpg
--boundary123--

